                                "sense_id": "9a21aeb7-318c-361b-bd68-62c83d64033f",
                                "text": "Sinister, an unicorn, argent; armed, unguled, mained, tufted, ducally collared, or; on the shoulder, a tirret, or. MOTTO."
                            },
